# ── FLOW: WEBSOCKET NOTIFICATION ────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Given "^checker notification counter is captured$"
    Given checker marks all notifications as read via api
    And checker is logged in to the trade portal
    And notification counter is captured

@When "^maker books one trade via api$"
    When a draft pending approval 'FX_TRF' trade is provisioned via playwright api

@Then "^checker notification count updates and content contains booked trade id$"
    Then notification counter bumps up
    And page trade portal opens notification center
    And page trade portal notification center contains from stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal clicks notification action url for stored trade id 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade detail container contains from stored variable 'createdTradeId'
